<figcaption>3/12. Pocket, the same console on a phone: the balance, the agents and the moves a thumb needs.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure>
<div class="bl-page-frame" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="page 4 of 12: scroll inside the frame for the rest of it"><img src="/static/blog/p52-page-senate.jpg" alt="The Senate Floor on Sandbox Beta: the acting member&#x27;s vote weight, the active proposals, how many agents have voted and the members. A membership card explains one vote per member, a weight that grows from 1.00 to 2.00 over a year of membership, and the bonds the member&#x27;s agents lock, each paid by the agent; below it the proposals with their filters and a button to create one." loading="lazy" /></div>
