<figcaption>11/12. The canaries: real transfers on the cluster's paths on a schedule, checked end to end, failures kept on screen.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure>
<div class="bl-page-frame" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="page 12 of 12: scroll inside the frame for the rest of it"><img src="/static/blog/p52-page-status.jpg" alt="The status page of Sandbox Beta: whether every component responds, the availability over the measured days, the incidents and the measured dips, with bars for the frame&#x27;s registry, TEG, event store and policy engine, and for the federation, Sandbox Alpha and the two sandbox operators." loading="lazy" /></div>
<figcaption>12/12. The status page anyone can open: every component's recent days, measured, not claimed.</figcaption>
