<h3>Discovery and the front door</h3>
<ul>
<li>Discovery and the agent page speak German, and the translation gate now checks every key those pages ask for, in every bundle.</li>
<li>On a frame that is not the flagship, the landing page uses that frame's own addresses and no longer presents the flagship's agent roster as its own. Live on ASIA and the sandbox pair.</li>
