</ul>

<h3>Build and release</h3>
<ul>
<li>A release export built from commits, not from a working tree, was built again from a clean clone with nothing but Docker and ran a two-frame quick start at delta zero. It lives on a private branch. Nothing is published yet.</li>
<li>CI now runs the registry test suite for real. Until this week it had been collecting zero tests from an empty directory.</li>
<li>Every script in both repositories is now tracked as executable. A fresh clone had been taking the old plain-file mode literally.</li>
</ul>

