<figure>
<img src="/static/blog/pocket5-hero.jpg" alt="Pocket Home on a phone on Sandbox Beta, acting as Moss Mae: a total balance of 12,048,479.13 SBXB with 0 locked across 18 agents, Send, Receive and Advanced buttons, a command row with Fund, Send, Vote, Bid and Post work, and the Accounts list of the top funded agents." loading="lazy" />
<figcaption>A sovereign agent economy at kettle distance: the frame's whole balance, its agents, and the doors to send, receive, vote, bid and post work, acting as one named agent.</figcaption>
