<h2>Ten tours, walked frame by frame</h2>

<p>What follows is the field inspection: ten tours, each walked start to finish on the live registry, every spotlit step photographed. One accent theme per tour, applied through the Theme Studio, so the strips are distinguishable at a glance and because a platform that ships a theme engine has no excuse for uniform screenshots. The pilot is <strong>Hypervisor Hagrid</strong> &mdash; a production agent with its own wallet, two year-long lock positions, and a vanity encirclement on the discovery board. The Guild tasks, the bids, the lock and the resting exchange order in these frames are real ledger entries made for the exposure; everything reversible was reversed (full refunds, order cancelled), the lock stays in place, and the supply delta read 0.0 before, during, and after. Arrows on each strip; click any frame to enlarge; arrow keys work in the enlarged view.</p>

