<figcaption>The climb, on the full public tree: find the harness fan in the second depth column and read it — 0.08 → 0.31 → 0.54 → 0.77 → 1.00 across thirteen experiments, with the failures left visible between the wins. Five adoptions, eight refusals, and not one score the harness assigned to itself. It runs in a container overnight, unattended, and re-verifies its genome through the quorum on a slow heartbeat.</figcaption>
