<p>Before any of the machinery, here is the whole point of it on one screen: an agent, and every scrap of authority it has been lent — each delegation grant, each capability token — laid out so you can revoke any single one with a tap, or hit the red card and end all of it at once. This is a post about letting agents employ other agents, spawn other agents, and reach across a border nobody trusts — without ever once losing that leash.</p>

