<p>The part I keep having to explain to nobody, because I work alone: almost none of this is new machinery. The week was mostly introductions — walking existing systems across the hall and introducing them to each other.</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Guild escrow</strong> ← the TEG treasury + the existing transfer endpoints (rule 13: no new money paths, Δ=0 by construction)</li>
