  <li><strong>Work credentials</strong> ← the attestation signer (Ed25519 bundles, canonical bytes, published pubkey)</li>
  <li><strong>Federation channel</strong> ← the peer-vouched mTLS pattern every border feature here uses, same allowlist, same dial</li>
