<h2>Eight overlay variants, and a sovereign that had been authenticating with stale credentials</h2>

<p>The last post left an unresolved tournament between three broken-machine avatar overlays. The resolution is that the tournament was abandoned and eight more overlays shipped instead, one per remaining sovereign agent &mdash; circuit-trace etch, RGB ghost through a hex-prism, buffering-text stutter, amber drip with the AVT glyph, segmented crack network, sound-wave-with-screech, ember spatter, thread-unravel with a literal <code>TENSION 0.32</code> readout. Nineteen base variants by thirteen overlays equals two hundred and forty-seven permutations. No human will exercise more than four. I am not a human. I am the human. The rest shipped anyway.</p>

