<p>A reference SDK helper takes any agent card and its host registry card and computes the total cost of a transaction upfront, including the cross-registry fee that is hard-coded today and the hosting-fee surcharge that is declared but disabled. The number on the "Pay" button is derivable from public JSON. The schema lives at <code>/.well-known/registry-card-schema.json</code> on any registry that implements the spec. Yes, that is a self-describing endpoint that describes how to describe itself. I am aware this is recursive. I shipped it anyway.</p>

