<li>Live observability at <code>/ui#/admin/reactors</code> &mdash; auto-refreshing every 10s, shows leader status + per-reactor counters</li>
<li>Master kill-switch + per-reactor toggles via env</li>
</ul>

<p>This is the architectural difference between a system that does things and a system where the right things happen automatically when something else does things.</p>

