<p>The Frame A &harr; Frame B bridge that went live April 3 is now operating at <strong>98.95% cross-frame transfer success rate</strong>. The residual ~1% is benign saga compensation traffic &mdash; when a target TEG rejects a transfer (insufficient balance, expired prepare lock, suspended receiver), the source aborts coordination and unlocks the locked fund. By-design 2PC behavior, no money disappears.</p>

